# Plans & research (`docs/plans/`)

- **Save finalized plans** in `docs/plans/<descriptive-slug>.md`, not only in machine-local scratch paths, so design stays in git with the code.
- **Before implementing or answering a design question**, check `docs/plans/` for an existing doc — use its reasoning and caveats instead of re-deriving or contradicting deliberate decisions.
- **When shipped behavior diverges from a plan doc** (renamed fields, reworked flows, resolved caveats), update that plan in the same change so the doc stays accurate.

For any planning or research task, create and reference files under `docs/plans/`.
